            "source": "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/cprt/catalog#/cprt/framework/version/SP_800_66_2_0_0/home",
            "description": "NIST SP 800-66 Rev. 2 overlay of the HIPAA Security Rule. control-id values are 800-66 section numbers (the overlay IDs). HIPAA 164.x citations are props. This is not NIST SP 800-53.",
