                "description": "GAP-05. aws_lambda_function.intake has vpc_config on private subnets with aws_security_group.lambda (egress 443 only). 800-66 has no separate boundary section; private-subnet placement is how this component limits who can intercept PHI in transit. Partial: no NAT or VPC endpoints, so runtime egress to AWS APIs is still incomplete.",
