                "control-id": "5.3.2",
                "description": "GRC wrap around the starter, not a named GAPS.md item. aws_cloudtrail.mgmt is a multi-region trail with log-file validation. aws_s3_bucket.vault has Object Lock GOVERNANCE. The GitHub Actions role aws_iam_role.grc_gate plans, applies on merge to main, Cosign-signs the evidence tarball keyless, and uploads it to the vault. No Rego detector; Terraform plus the pipeline are the implementation.",
